    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        104.793701171875,
        522.9771728515625,
        143.51361083984375
      ],
      "text": "Good enough to put in a frame on the wall. The images are just beautiful. Finn,\nwhat did you find?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        156.45205688476562,
        104.5427017211914,
        175.95346069335938
      ],
      "text": "FINN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        176.43470764160156,
        516.2945556640625,
        254.8736114501953
      ],
      "text": "I've got some pages from a programme for Man of La Mancha. I thought this\nwas a good programme to show, not because of the pictures, but because it\ncontains articles written by members of the theatre company, so we can learn\nhow the production was created and the thoughts and feelings of the cast.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        267.6920471191406,
        112.34269714355469,
        287.1934509277344
      ],
      "text": "MAYA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        287.793701171875,
        498.08404541015625,
        346.3135986328125
      ],
      "text": "Good. I’ve got a copy of a programme that’s now in a museum. It’s for The\nTragedy of Jane Shore and it’s said to be the earliest surviving document to\nhave been printed on Australia’s first printing press.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        359.2520446777344,
        104.5427017211914,
        378.7534484863281
      ],
      "text": "FINN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        379.23468017578125,
        130.92311096191406,
        398.0335998535156
      ],
      "text": "Fantastic!\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        410.85205078125,
        112.34269714355469,
        430.35345458984375
      ],
      "text": "MAYA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        430.9546813964844,
        518.422119140625,
        489.4736022949219
      ],
      "text": "Another programme to talk about is for The Sailors Festival. It comes from the\nBritish Library’s digitised collection of programmes that was started a few\nyears ago. It already comprises over 200,000 programmes which is amazing!\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        502.4110107421875,
        104.5427017211914,
        521.9124145507812
      ],
