      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        522.3937377929688,
        418.1372985839844,
        541.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "Huh. Wish I’d known about it while I was doing my research.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        588.092041015625,
        112.94929504394531,
        607.5934448242188
